  "description": "Adds a video player to your app with the transport controls users expect: play, pause, seek, volume, and looping. It also supports letterboxing, captions, chapters, and custom color or drawing effects over the picture, and can use the GPU for smooth playback when one is available. It plays WebM and Matroska video files, including AV1-encoded content, through a fully managed decoder with no native codec to install.",
